2026-11-16T00:00:00Z (RFD66606-2496) 'ZFS data disks on the Mac desk
 # uuid: ddbeb808-781a-5d4a-91b4-120c2bbb2dcb
 # tags: rfd:title
 RFD:Discussion  1 RFD
 Serials:VSekaiFabric

2026-11-16T00:00:01Z (RFD66606-2496) 'a data disk on the Mac desk is one ZFS pool whose settings are fixed at creation.
 # tags: rfd:feature
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:02Z (RFD66606-2496) 'the Mac desk's external data disks: the check before a wipe, the pool, its proof.
 # tags: rfd:scope
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:03Z (RFD66606-2496) 'Which settings of a ZFS pool can never change once the disk holds data, and what must be
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2496) 'true of a disk before anyone wipes it?
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2496) '
 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2496) 'Nothing in the workspace said how to prepare a ZFS disk. The first one was a 4 TB external
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2496) 'drive whose partition table named a FAT volume, while its first sector held zeros. Sampling
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:08Z (RFD66606-2496) '125 places across it found only zeros, so the label was stale and the disk was empty. The
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:09Z (RFD66606-2496) 'settings that the Mac file browser needs, folded Unicode names and case-insensitive lookups,
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2496) 'are the ones that cannot be changed afterwards.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2496) '
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2496) 'Read the section "The recorded run" for the commands. Run its checks against any pool: it
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2496) 'passes when every check prints its expected line, and the case control leaves one file.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2496) '
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2496) 'ZFS data disks on the Mac desk
 # tags: rfd:details-title
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2496) '- A data disk is one whole-disk pool made with the OpenZFS port for the Mac (operator,
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2496) '  2026-11-16). The disk is chosen by media name and byte size, never by its disk number.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2496) '- The pool is created with a 4096-byte sector shift, zstd compression, no access times, one
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2496) '  copy of each block, folded Unicode names, case-insensitive lookups and UTF-8 names only.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2496) '- Before the wipe, the disk is unmounted, sampled for existing data, and the operator
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-2496) '  approves the wipe by name.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:22Z (RFD66606-2496) '- The pool is done when it reads ONLINE, its settings read back, a written file hashes the
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:23Z (RFD66606-2496) '  same after a sync, a second name differing only in case replaces the first, a scrub finds
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:24Z (RFD66606-2496) '  no errors and the pool survives an export and an import.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:25Z (RFD66606-2496) '- A pool is exported before its disk is unplugged. Boot pools on other hosts are out of
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:26Z (RFD66606-2496) '  scope.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:27Z (RFD66606-2496) '
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:28Z (RFD66606-2496) '- RFD66606-2294, the rule that agent knowledge lives in RFDs.
 # tags: rfd:related
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2496) '
