2026-11-16T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-2496) 'The recorded run
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-2496) 'The first pool is FIRE202610 on a 4.0 TB external USB drive, 7,814,037,168 sectors of 512
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-2496) 'bytes. The tools are in `/usr/local/zfs/bin`, version 2.3.1, and the kernel module is loaded.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:33Z (RFD66606-2496) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:34Z (RFD66606-2496) 'Before the wipe, the desk read the media name, the byte size and the partition table with
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:35Z (RFD66606-2496) '`diskutil`, then read 4096 bytes at 125 places of the data partition, including the start,
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:36Z (RFD66606-2496) 'the middle and the end. All 125 were zeros. A dry run with `zpool create -n` accepted the
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:37Z (RFD66606-2496) 'options before the real one.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:38Z (RFD66606-2496) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:39Z (RFD66606-2496) 'The pool is created with these options:
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:40Z (RFD66606-2496) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:41Z (RFD66606-2496) '```sh
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:42Z (RFD66606-2496) 'sudo diskutil unmountDisk force disk6
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:43Z (RFD66606-2496) 'sudo /usr/local/zfs/bin/zpool create -f \
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:44Z (RFD66606-2496) '  -o ashift=12 -o autoexpand=on \
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:45Z (RFD66606-2496) '  -O compression=zstd -O atime=off -O copies=1 \
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:46Z (RFD66606-2496) '  -O normalization=formD -O casesensitivity=insensitive -O utf8only=on \
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:47Z (RFD66606-2496) '  -O mountpoint=/Volumes/FIRE202610 \
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:48Z (RFD66606-2496) '  FIRE202610 /dev/disk6
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:49Z (RFD66606-2496) '```
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:50Z (RFD66606-2496) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:51Z (RFD66606-2496) 'The properties normalization, casesensitivity and utf8only cannot be changed after
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:00:52Z (RFD66606-2496) 'creation. Compression and copies can be changed, and they apply to data written afterwards.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

