 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:01:08Z (RFD66606-2496) '  `sudo zpool import <name>` mounts it again. `zpool import` without sudo fails with
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:01:09Z (RFD66606-2496) '  permission denied.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-16T00:01:10Z (RFD66606-2496) '
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2496  1 LINE
 Text:Written

